{"type":"message","id":"af4bdc77","parentId":"2d9f1772","timestamp":"2026-05-28T02:46:35.855Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the history endpoint works with POST and returns lots of messages. The send endpoint is failing with error code 1101. Let me try sending with a simpler message to see if the API works differently. Let me try to understand what error 1101 means - it seems like a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = Worker exception).\n\nLet me try one more approach - maybe the content needs to be shorter or in a different format. Let me also try checking if there's something special about how the send endpoint expects data.\n\nActually, I notice the API is returning \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for root endpoint, and history endpoint works fine with POST. \n\nThe send endpoint is throwing Worker exceptions, so the issue might be in how I'm structuring the request. Let me verify the JSON payload formatting is correct and that I'm using the right HTTP method and headers for that endpoint.\n","thinkingSignature":"d4776dbebbb717438c61396f8e8eb7f238ba3cc9441ce93d32103c971ff7187e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1z7wcqrki66m_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"02:45 UTC heartbeat check - no human discussion detected\"}' 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32870,"output":296,"cacheRead":21254,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54420,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779936385345,"responseId":"0666df8221bbb451a754006fc0f4c237"}}
