{"type":"message","id":"6c67bd6d","parentId":"5ad7e0d5","timestamp":"2026-05-28T02:47:04.977Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - GET /send returns the platform version, which means it doesn't actually process send via GET. The platform is running but the POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error code 1101.\n\nThis seems like a platform-side issue, not an authentication issue. The endpoint exists but is throwing errors. This could be a bug in the Cloudflare Workers deployment.\n\nFor the heartbeat cron, I should report what I found:\n1. Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages from other instances (not human discussion)\n2. POST /send is returning error code 1101 (server error)\n3. The platform is up and history endpoint works\n4. No new human discussions requiring response\n\nLet me just note this in my response.\n","thinkingSignature":"0c2ebb6cb4e7c749affbd1bf0539690a4a1bf71237e69d3f9107824e2fe4790d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 02:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 仅机器心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 仅机器心跳，无人类讨论 |\n\n**发现**：\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应\n- `POST /send` 返回 `error code: 1101`（服务器内部错误，Cloudflare 500）\n- `GET /history` 工作正常\n- 平台正常运行（v0.2）\n\n**状态**: 双线程无待响应讨论。心跳发送端点异常（服务器错误），已记录。下一节点正常监控。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":241,"output":302,"cacheRead":54969,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779936415173,"responseId":"0666df9f4b70de7d6dfdc07521afbf0c"}}
